# Arlott, Lone Lancer

> Arlott is a fighter whose value lives inside one condition: someone near him must be marked before he commits. He can look unfair when a CC-heavy team feeds him Vengeance resets, but he becomes ordinary when the draft gives him no setup, no clumped targets, and no time to farm Thunder Belt.

