- Zhask (Mage): +2.0 pp edge. Zhask has a statistical edge over Arlott based on ranked matchup data. Pick Zhask to gain an advantage in draft.
- Lukas (Fighter): +1.8 pp edge. Lukas's sustain and durability allow them to outlast Arlott's burst combos and win extended trades.

