## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-07. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### EXP Lane Default (EXP)

- Items: Tough Boots, Thunder Belt, Hunter Strike, Dominance Ice, Oracle, Queen's Wings
- Core: Thunder Belt, Hunter Strike, Dominance Ice
- Emblem: Fighter Emblem with Rupture, Festival of Blood, Brave Smite
- Battle spell: Petrify
- Flex: Athena's Shield over Oracle when Use against burst mages that decide the fight with the first combo.; Radiant Armor over Oracle when Use against repeated magic damage that keeps ticking through extended Vengeance chains.; Immortality over Queen's Wings when Use after the next death would decide Lord, base, or a full late-game wipe.
- Total cost: 10650 gold

Default EXP setup for ranked games where Arlott needs Thunder Belt contact damage, Hunter Strike tempo, and enough sustain to chain marked targets.

### Pickoff Damage Bridge (EXP)

- Items: Tough Boots, Thunder Belt, War Axe, Hunter Strike, Oracle, Queen's Wings
- Core: Thunder Belt, War Axe, Hunter Strike
- Emblem: Assassin Emblem with Rupture, Festival of Blood, Brave Smite
- Battle spell: Petrify
- Flex: Dominance Ice over War Axe when Use when enemy sustain, shields, or attack-speed carries matter more than extra damage.; Malefic Roar over Oracle when Use only when your team is ahead and the enemy front line is stacking Physical Defense.; Athena's Shield over Oracle when Use when magic burst is the only thing stopping your second Vengeance.
- Total cost: 10740 gold

Snowball setup for games where allied CC gives Arlott reliable first contact and the team needs him to threaten backline kills earlier.

### Defensive Frontline (EXP)

- Items: Tough Boots, Thunder Belt, Dominance Ice, Antique Cuirass, Oracle, Immortality
- Core: Thunder Belt, Dominance Ice, Antique Cuirass
- Emblem: Tank Emblem with Vitality, Tenacity, Brave Smite
- Battle spell: Petrify
- Flex: Radiant Armor over Antique Cuirass when Use against repeated magic damage when physical skill burst is not the main threat.; Blade Armor over Antique Cuirass when Use against basic-attack carries that must hit Arlott during front-to-back fights.; Queen's Wings over Immortality when Use before true late game when one more low-HP reset is more valuable than a revive.
- Total cost: 10680 gold

Low-economy frontline setup for hard physical lanes or drafts where Arlott must absorb the first counter-engage before chasing resets.

